# Plans live in this repo

Plans for this project belong in `.cursor/plans/` at the repo root (`c:\dev\kewlkids\.cursor\plans`).

When you create or update a plan:

- Write the plan file in `.cursor/plans/`. Use a descriptive filename ending in `.plan.md`.
- If a plan is written to the user plans folder (`%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\plans`), copy it into `.cursor/plans/` in this repo in the same turn. Keep the repo file as the source of truth.
- Do not leave a plan for this project only in the user plans folder.
- Do not copy plans that belong to other projects (Booty Cup, Ryder Cup, golf, Coyote Creek, CCP3, app-admin, Tee-onBot) into this repo.

```text
.cursor/plans/seasonal_bills_match.plan.md
```
